      "message": "**Issue #1 (🟡 Medium Severity (SHOULD FIX))**: Deprecated `Return From Keyword If` keyword\n\n**Issue**: `Return From Keyword If` was deprecated in Robot Framework 5.0. The project is expected to run on RF 5+ and should use the modern `IF / RETURN` syntax.\n-\n\n**Fix**:\n```robotframework\n        IF  ${enabled}    RETURN\n  ```\n\n**Why**: Deprecated keywords may emit deprecation warnings in test logs and will be removed in a future RF major version, causing test infrastructure failures.",
